/**
 * Truncates a string to a maximum length, appending a suffix if cut.
 * @param str    - The input string.
 * @param maxLen - Maximum allowed length (including suffix).
 * @param suffix - Appended when truncation occurs. Defaults to "...".
 * @returns The original string, or a truncated version with the suffix.
