## Design Principles Applied

| Principle | Where |
|---|---|
| **Separate `execute` from `register`** | Each command exports both; only `execute` is unit-tested |
| **Dependency injection via env var** | `TALLY_DATA_DIR` lets tests redirect file I/O |
| **Mock at the module boundary** | `jest.mock('../../src/lib/storage')` keeps command tests fast |
| **Custom error class** | `TallyError` distinguishes user errors from bugs |
| **Barrel export** | `commands/index.js` keeps `bin/tally.js` clean |
| **Coverage thresholds** | Enforced in `jest.config.js` to prevent regressions |

