## Design Principles Applied

| Principle | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Separation of concerns** | CLI wiring (`register`) is isolated from pure logic (`execute`) |
| **Testability** | `execute()` functions take plain data — no I/O, no Commander dependency |
| **Single responsibility** | `storage`, `formatter`, `logger` each own one job |
| **Environment override** | `TALLY_DATA_DIR` env var lets tests redirect file writes |
| **Barrel exports** | `commands/index.js` keeps `bin/tally.js` clean |

