## Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| `bin/` vs `src/` split | Keeps the shebang entry point thin; all logic lives in testable modules |
| `commands/index.js` barrel | Single registration call in `bin/`; easy to add new commands |
| `TALLY_DATA_DIR` env var | Lets tests redirect file I/O without touching `$HOME` |
| `jest.mock('../../src/lib/storage')` | Fully isolates command logic from disk in unit tests |
| `program.exitOverride()` | Converts `process.exit` calls into catchable errors in tests |
| `coverageThreshold` in Jest config | Enforces a minimum safety net as the project grows |

