## Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| `bin/` separated from `src/` | Keeps the shebang entry point minimal; `src/` stays testable |
| `commands/index.js` registry | Adding a command = one `require()` line, no changes elsewhere |
| `register(program)` pattern | Each command is self-contained and independently testable |
| `storage` fully mocked in tests | Commands stay unit-tested; no filesystem side-effects |
| `program.exitOverride()` in tests | Prevents `process.exit()` from killing the Jest runner |

