## Design Principles Applied

| Principle | Where it appears |
|---|---|
| **Thin entry point** | `bin/tally.js` only wires Commander; no logic |
| **Separated concerns** | `execute()` is pure business logic, `register()` handles CLI wiring |
| **Mockable I/O** | `store.js` is a standalone module → easy to `jest.mock()` |
| **Real I/O tests** | `store.test.js` uses `os.tmpdir()` for true filesystem tests |
| **Barrel export** | `commands/index.js` keeps `bin/` decoupled from individual files |

